{"title":"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> between 10 and 99, inclusive, is chosen at random. If every such integer is equally likely to be chosen, what is the probability that the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is a multiple of 7?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can see that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcfee7bd8a5e15e5f6b7881c138de43651572a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> two-digit numbers and that we are picking from all two-digit numbers. If this wasn't known, we can realize that the number of two-digit numbers would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/e/3ce355909712ae7053e7e239912edbd6fd9fb767.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99 - 10 + 1 = 89 + 1 = 90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"208\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>The largest possible sum would be where the two digits are maximized, which occurs with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a313bf06349648df7be807bee95b651604ce7a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a313bf06349648df7be807bee95b651604ce7a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/7/d17ebc4f23fcc9579bcab96f79fdbb942d9985f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 + 9 = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>The minimum sum would be where the two digits are minimized, which occurs with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/6/586e64c2b6aebf903e473aa7f46f730d232ab6b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 0 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Since the number is a two-digit number and must have a sum of the digits that is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, this means that we can either have a sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or a sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820a20de2847dfdc1bc5cffc8d904933150032bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, as those are the multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> while being greater than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. This means that we can split the problem into two cases: one where the number has a sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and another where the sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820a20de2847dfdc1bc5cffc8d904933150032bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>If the sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we can realize that we can choose one of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/3/d037f1aa313d30fe7ade693f1b672ed2a68880fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$34$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/8/c38d81afc2fb4328ead7dde7d51221bdbac7bc53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$43$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/1/5e1d1611143f5792dc0f61f3b130af88cb790c04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$52$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/6/866b44935f69a5b800547127fe13210bb1e36fbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$61$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa94edfb9739dcc66dad90f7dd5c148f44a57e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. This would give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> different numbers.\n</p><p>If the sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820a20de2847dfdc1bc5cffc8d904933150032bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, we can get the following numbers: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/e/afe61e5b80572ad5a200a0d9cd354ce12a8c7800.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$59$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/8/9782dd7447f84ce6adcf7945b86038e379c618f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$68$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/f/7af4b3f8897671e2879b10badf471e5deec8952e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$77$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/c/56c6169a64f8271966651402df19345f38ae0c4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$86$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/1/0510fa96a9909623c5966ad29945fabc84c704a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$95$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> possibilities.\n</p><p>In total, this would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/2/cf249118cf34e6b3d122ee38a1a0da9422f423c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 + 5 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> possibilities.\n</p><p>Thus, the probability of choosing a two-digit number whose digit sum is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/9/2a97a47a32bf49ac6dac50767653c20a9d60e050.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{12}{90} = \\frac{12 \\div 6}{90 \\div 6} = \\boxed{\\frac{2}{15}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"159\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC\">2017 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_3\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 3\">Individual Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Individual Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_1\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 1\">Individual 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Individual 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_3\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 3\">Individual 3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Individual 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Individual 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Individual 6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">Individual 7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">Individual 8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 9 (page does not exist)\">Individual 9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 10 (page does not exist)\">Individual 10</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_0_Problem_A\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 0 Problem A\">Relay 0 A</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_0_Problem_B\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 0 Problem B\">Relay 0 B</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_0_Problem_C\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 0 Problem C\">Relay 0 C</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_A\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 1 Problem A\">Relay 1 A</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_B\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 1 Problem B\">Relay 1 B</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_C\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 1 Problem C\">Relay 1 C</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_2_Problem_A\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 2 Problem A\">Relay 2 A</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_2_Problem_B&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 2 Problem B (page does not exist)\">Relay 2 B</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_2_Problem_C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 2 Problem C (page does not exist)\">Relay 2 C</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_3_Problem_A&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 3 Problem A (page does not exist)\">Relay 3 A</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_3_Problem_B&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 3 Problem B (page does not exist)\">Relay 3 B</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_3_Problem_C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 3 Problem C (page does not exist)\">Relay 3 C</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Team 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_2\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 2\">Team 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Team 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Team 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Team 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Team 6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">Team 7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">Team 8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 9 (page does not exist)\">Team 9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 10 (page does not exist)\">Team 10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 11 (page does not exist)\">Team 11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 12 (page does not exist)\">Team 12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 13 (page does not exist)\">Team 13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 14 (page does not exist)\">Team 14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 15 (page does not exist)\">Team 15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 16 (page does not exist)\">Team 16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 17 (page does not exist)\">Team 17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 18 (page does not exist)\">Team 18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 19 (page does not exist)\">Team 19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 20 (page does not exist)\">Team 20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 21 (page does not exist)\">Team 21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 22 (page does not exist)\">Team 22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 23 (page does not exist)\">Team 23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 24 (page does not exist)\">Team 24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 25 (page does not exist)\">Team 25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Canadian_Team_Mathematics_Contest\" title=\"CEMC Canadian Team Mathematics Contest\">CEMC Canadian Team Mathematics Contest</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018061416\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 194/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4031/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 212/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6381/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.088      1 Template:CEMC_CTMC_box\n100.00%    8.088      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36128:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018061416 and revision id 280256. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}